= The Death of Napoleone Colajanni

Napoleone Colajanni, <span style="color:#ED2855">socialist</span>, <span style="color:#3CB371">republican</span> and leader of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3CB371">Italian Republican Party</span>, has passed away. He is succeeded by Eugenio Chiesa, a committed <span style="color:#3CB371">republican</span> who is less likely to work with us. preferring alliances and cooperation with the <span style="color:#0047AB;">libe</span><span style="color:#FFD700;">rals</span>.

He will be missed.